{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17097","headline":"和武相公中秋锦楼翫月 二 · 崔备","name":"和武相公中秋锦楼翫月 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四时皆有月，一夜独当秋。\n照耀初含露，裴回正满楼。\n遥连雪山净，逈入锦江流。\n愿以清光末，年年许从游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔备","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17097.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17097","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}